1
00:00:38,679 --> 00:00:39,700
What are you doing?

2
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:43,679
I still have warehouse duty.

3
00:00:46,799 --> 00:00:47,799
You're already this drunk.

4
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:49,759
If you sleep in the duty room,

5
00:00:50,799 --> 00:00:51,960
it'll be trouble if you catch a cold.

6
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:54,640
I'm not drunk.

7
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:55,479
I know, I know. Hold on a sec.

8
00:00:55,479 --> 00:00:57,560
I'm totally sober, let me tell you.

9
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:03,219
As long as you remember what I said today.

10
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:06,799
Are you kidding me?

11
00:01:09,579 --> 00:01:10,379
Let me tell you.

12
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:13,519
From now on, you're mine.

13
00:01:13,739 --> 00:01:15,319
I keep my word.

14
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,939
I'll definitely make you happy.

15
00:01:18,780 --> 00:01:19,680
Do you believe me?

16
00:01:20,379 --> 00:01:21,299
I believe you, I do.

17
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:24,760
From now on, you're mine.

18
00:01:25,319 --> 00:01:25,819
Okay.

19
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:29,019
Come on, take off your coat.

20
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:30,319
Your hands are freezing.

21
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:33,680
Why take off my coat?

22
00:01:33,879 --> 00:01:35,540
You can't lie in bed with your coat on.

23
00:01:35,959 --> 00:01:36,400
Come on.

24
00:01:42,019 --> 00:01:42,700
Easy, easy.

25
00:01:43,340 --> 00:01:43,879
Come here.

26
00:01:44,719 --> 00:01:45,120
Careful.

27
00:01:45,239 --> 00:01:46,140
I'm really fine.

28
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:46,980
I know.

29
00:01:47,420 --> 00:01:48,140
Alright.

30
00:01:48,599 --> 00:01:49,079
I...

31
00:01:49,719 --> 00:01:50,579
Let me tell you...

32
00:01:51,719 --> 00:01:52,280
I...

33
00:01:52,599 --> 00:01:53,180
I'm...

34
00:01:53,359 --> 00:01:54,879
A tough woman like me...

35
00:01:58,299 --> 00:01:59,280
If anyone messes with you from now on,

36
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:01,060
tell me, and I'll drink them under the table!

37
00:02:01,159 --> 00:02:01,739
Alright, alright.

38
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:03,120
Have some water.

39
00:02:04,459 --> 00:02:04,879
Here.

40
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,359
Here.

41
00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:10,099
Come on.

42
00:02:10,460 --> 00:02:10,919
Take it slow.

43
00:02:21,580 --> 00:02:22,219
Easy, easy.

44
00:02:24,139 --> 00:02:25,639
Thank you.

45
00:02:27,180 --> 00:02:27,740
Don't move.

46
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,719
Let me pull out the quilt and cover you up.

47
00:02:37,780 --> 00:02:39,360
Where's the button I sewed on for you?

48
00:02:42,300 --> 00:02:43,919
That's not the one I sewed.

49
00:02:44,099 --> 00:02:45,439
It's not this one.

50
00:02:45,620 --> 00:02:46,159
No.

51
00:02:46,759 --> 00:02:47,819
This isn't it either.

52
00:02:48,780 --> 00:02:49,500
Of course not.

53
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,620
It's not this jacket.

54
00:02:50,699 --> 00:02:52,560
The button I sewed on for you...

55
00:02:53,060 --> 00:02:53,919
You threw it away?

56
00:04:27,759 --> 00:04:29,079
I'm yours now.

57
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:31,160
Zhou Meng.

58
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:46,500
Zhou Meng,

59
00:04:48,740 --> 00:04:49,500
I have to marry you.

60
00:04:51,259 --> 00:04:52,040
Marry honorably and properly.

61
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:54,980
Not like this.

62
00:04:57,439 --> 00:04:58,279
It can't be like this.

63
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:01,339
I'll bring twenty Phoenix bicycles

64
00:05:02,139 --> 00:05:03,899
and bring you home in grand style.

65
00:05:04,980 --> 00:05:06,240
I have to let everyone know

66
00:05:07,180 --> 00:05:08,220
that I'll treat you well for the rest of my life.

67
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:02,980
Chief Liao

68
00:06:10,439 --> 00:06:10,939
Chief Liao,

69
00:06:12,579 --> 00:06:14,920
let me brief you on the current situation.

70
00:06:16,180 --> 00:06:17,879
The heavy-duty padlock on the warehouse gate...

71
00:06:18,300 --> 00:06:19,060
was cut open by these guys

72
00:06:19,180 --> 00:06:21,379
using professional tools.

73
00:06:22,019 --> 00:06:23,560
What's the estimated financial loss?

74
00:06:24,100 --> 00:06:24,939
Financial loss?

75
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:27,160
Estimated at 238,000.

76
00:06:28,100 --> 00:06:28,579
Chief Liao,

77
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:29,899
about this...

78
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:30,879
it was my oversight.

79
00:06:31,199 --> 00:06:32,060
I never expected these guys

80
00:06:32,100 --> 00:06:33,819
to strike on New Year's Eve

81
00:06:34,319 --> 00:06:35,259
and steal this shipment.

82
00:06:35,959 --> 00:06:36,500
For this,

83
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,180
I take full responsibility.

84
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,339
I underestimated them.

85
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:40,920
Kong Fanping.

86
00:06:41,259 --> 00:06:43,360
I want hard evidence and results.

87
00:06:43,819 --> 00:06:44,259
Yes, sir.

88
00:06:44,939 --> 00:06:45,680
Rest assured, Chief Liao.

89
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,839
We've already redeployed our team.

90
00:06:48,079 --> 00:06:48,699
Within a week,

91
00:06:49,540 --> 00:06:50,079
we'll definitely crack this case.

92
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:53,000
No cunning fox can outsmart a good hunter.

93
00:06:53,839 --> 00:06:54,439
Dig into it.

94
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:56,139
Dig as deep as you can!

95
00:06:56,579 --> 00:06:57,000
Understood.

96
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:59,920
During shift handover last night,

97
00:07:00,699 --> 00:07:01,879
who else took inventory of the warehouse?

98
00:07:03,220 --> 00:07:06,660
Two comrades from transport and the warehouse,

99
00:07:07,379 --> 00:07:08,399
and one from security.

100
00:07:10,139 --> 00:07:12,279
We do an inventory every week after work.

101
00:07:13,180 --> 00:07:14,160
Since it was New Year's Eve,

102
00:07:14,620 --> 00:07:15,480
we checked even more thoroughly.

103
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,100
Everything's recorded in the log.

104
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:17,720
What about locking up?

105
00:07:18,300 --> 00:07:19,040
Who locked the door?

106
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:21,779
Only the warehouse and security have keys.

107
00:07:22,379 --> 00:07:24,259
Then how long were you away from the warehouse?

108
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:27,620
Well...

109
00:07:31,620 --> 00:07:32,800
I don't really know that either.

110
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,459
How could you not know?

111
00:07:35,060 --> 00:07:36,240
I was on duty the whole time.

112
00:07:37,180 --> 00:07:39,319
I reported it as soon as I noticed.

113
00:07:39,620 --> 00:07:40,319
While on duty,

114
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:41,939
and the goods just vanished?

115
00:07:42,959 --> 00:07:43,519
I...

116
00:07:44,779 --> 00:07:45,480
I drank too much.

117
00:07:45,879 --> 00:07:47,660
I failed to watch the warehouse.

118
00:07:48,220 --> 00:07:50,240
Liu Haizhu has nothing to do with this.

119
00:07:51,019 --> 00:07:51,980
It's all on me.

120
00:07:52,459 --> 00:07:53,660
Drinking while on duty?

121
00:07:54,300 --> 00:07:55,120
Whose idea was it?

122
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,100
Mine.

123
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:58,980
Zhou Meng didn't want to drink.

124
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,339
I talked her into it.

125
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:01,779
Blame me if you must.

126
00:08:02,220 --> 00:08:03,319
Drinking on duty

127
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:04,420
and leaving your post...

128
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:05,759
That's a dereliction of duty.

129
00:08:07,319 --> 00:08:08,480
I know I messed up.

130
00:08:09,540 --> 00:08:10,279
It's all my fault.

131
00:08:10,540 --> 00:08:11,579
I shouldn't have drunk.

132
00:08:11,899 --> 00:08:13,779
And I shouldn't have left my post.

133
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:16,699
But losing both the truck and the cargo...

134
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:18,740
There's no way we did that!

135
00:08:19,699 --> 00:08:21,240
After Liu Haizhu took me home,

136
00:08:21,540 --> 00:08:22,680
he went right back to work.

137
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:25,019
He called the police right after seeing the theft.

138
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,639
We'd never steal on our own watch!

139
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:30,139
Aside from you two last night,

140
00:08:31,620 --> 00:08:32,539
who else went to the warehouse?

141
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:38,799
Zhuzi...

142
00:08:39,580 --> 00:08:40,940
Make sure your footing is solid.

143
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:44,139
Keep your fate in your own hands.

144
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:45,519
Otherwise,

145
00:08:46,460 --> 00:08:48,000
they can take it back whenever they want.

146
00:08:50,940 --> 00:08:51,539
Nobody.

147
00:08:52,779 --> 00:08:53,360
No one else.

148
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:54,620
Can you swear to that?

149
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,600
Withholding information is also a crime.

150
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,360
Think carefully.

151
00:09:04,860 --> 00:09:05,659
Last night,

152
00:09:06,159 --> 00:09:07,879
did anything else suspicious happen?

153
00:09:11,580 --> 00:09:12,220
Anything at all?

154
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,480
No.

155
00:09:15,759 --> 00:09:17,259
But Ma Limin is definitely suspicious.

156
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,500
Why suspect him?

157
00:09:19,679 --> 00:09:20,980
He's always had it out for me.

158
00:09:23,139 --> 00:09:25,259
He suddenly blocked my family leave this time

159
00:09:25,580 --> 00:09:28,460
and put me on duty on New Year's Eve out of nowhere.

160
00:09:29,059 --> 00:09:30,200
It's just way too fishy.

161
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:31,899
Liu Haizhu only meant well.

162
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:33,960
He was worried I wouldn't be safe alone on shift,

163
00:09:34,059 --> 00:09:35,100
so he came over to keep me company.

164
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,220
He doesn't know anything.

165
00:09:36,299 --> 00:09:37,940
This has nothing to do with him.

166
00:09:38,460 --> 00:09:40,200
It's entirely my responsibility.

167
00:09:40,679 --> 00:09:42,200
Punish me however you must,

168
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,460
but please don't give him a hard time.

169
00:09:43,740 --> 00:09:44,279
Officer,

170
00:09:45,340 --> 00:09:46,860
Zhou Meng doesn't know anything.

171
00:09:47,740 --> 00:09:48,980
From start to finish,

172
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:50,759
this has nothing to do with her.

173
00:09:51,639 --> 00:09:52,620
If you want to question someone, question me.

174
00:10:02,100 --> 00:10:03,220
Zhou Meng, Liu Haizhu.

175
00:10:04,259 --> 00:10:05,360
There's no evidence proving

176
00:10:05,460 --> 00:10:06,559
you were directly involved in the theft.

177
00:10:07,139 --> 00:10:07,740
But,

178
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:09,759
you abandoned your posts while on duty,

179
00:10:10,100 --> 00:10:11,759
resulting in a massive loss of state assets.

180
00:10:12,620 --> 00:10:13,779
You're formally notified

181
00:10:14,259 --> 00:10:15,659
that until this case is resolved,

182
00:10:16,519 --> 00:10:17,679
you must remain in Songliao,

183
00:10:18,139 --> 00:10:18,919
on call at all times.

184
00:10:26,580 --> 00:10:28,600
So does that mean we're...

185
00:10:31,340 --> 00:10:32,019
Head back for now.

186
00:10:33,820 --> 00:10:34,320
Just head back.

187
00:11:04,779 --> 00:11:05,240
Zhou Meng

188
00:11:23,919 --> 00:11:24,740
You've been interrogated for three days.

189
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,039
Are you okay?

190
00:11:39,039 --> 00:11:39,799
Do you trust me?

191
00:11:43,340 --> 00:11:43,779
Go back to the factory.

192
00:11:44,559 --> 00:11:45,000
Wait for me.

193
00:11:46,740 --> 00:11:47,600
There's something

194
00:11:48,779 --> 00:11:49,700
I have to take care of right now.

195
00:12:14,919 --> 00:12:15,960
A classic diversion.

196
00:12:16,559 --> 00:12:18,059
They completely played me.

197
00:12:18,860 --> 00:12:20,000
Unbelievably brazen.

198
00:12:20,519 --> 00:12:22,240
I've never seen anyone this brazen.

199
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,679
That scared me to death, Master.

200
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:25,899
Calm down.

201
00:12:26,059 --> 00:12:26,500
Investigate.

202
00:12:27,419 --> 00:12:28,879
Check everyone involved.

203
00:12:30,159 --> 00:12:31,779
Even if we have to turn Songliao upside down,

204
00:12:32,059 --> 00:12:33,879
root out these warehouse rats!

205
00:12:34,039 --> 00:12:34,500
Yes, sir!

206
00:13:03,620 --> 00:13:04,340
Bro, you want this?

207
00:13:04,639 --> 00:13:05,379
Pass.

208
00:13:07,820 --> 00:13:10,460
If it isn't the famous worker Liu Haizhu! Brother Zhuzi!

209
00:13:10,740 --> 00:13:11,179
Look at you.

210
00:13:11,179 --> 00:13:12,960
Now we can't even see you until year-end.

211
00:13:13,460 --> 00:13:15,720
What, so deep in love you can't pull yourself out?

212
00:13:16,340 --> 00:13:17,019
Where's Zhou Meng?

213
00:13:28,179 --> 00:13:28,840
Ziwen.

214
00:13:30,379 --> 00:13:31,259
Was it you?

215
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:35,799
What do you mean?

216
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:39,440
New Year's Eve.

217
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:42,059
The night of New Year's Eve.

218
00:13:43,820 --> 00:13:44,580
Was it you?

219
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:50,639
Brother Zhuzi,

220
00:13:51,039 --> 00:13:52,419
what's wrong? What happened?

221
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:57,639
On New Year's Eve,

222
00:13:59,019 --> 00:14:00,000
at our shipyard,

223
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,080
the one who took the supplies...

224
00:14:04,700 --> 00:14:05,539
was it you?

225
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:09,940
Zhuzi, what's that supposed to mean?

226
00:14:10,519 --> 00:14:11,320
In the middle of the New Year,

227
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:12,799
what are you even talking about?

228
00:14:30,620 --> 00:14:31,320
You

229
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:33,399
suspect me?

230
00:14:37,759 --> 00:14:38,399
Tell me.

231
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:40,240
Yes

232
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:42,059
or no?

233
00:14:51,279 --> 00:14:52,419
You already think it was me.

234
00:14:53,179 --> 00:14:54,399
You've already convicted me in your mind.

235
00:14:55,960 --> 00:14:57,500
Why even come and ask me?

236
00:14:59,340 --> 00:15:01,019
I want to hear it from your own mouth!

237
00:15:09,899 --> 00:15:11,539
You think I, Feng Ziwen, am a thief?

238
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:13,779
That for some petty cash,

239
00:15:13,940 --> 00:15:15,179
I'd rob, I'd steal,

240
00:15:15,360 --> 00:15:17,059
and pull scummy shit like that, is that it?

241
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:19,720
In your mind,

242
00:15:19,779 --> 00:15:21,080
am I really that kind of trash?

243
00:15:21,779 --> 00:15:23,120
Zhuzi, let's talk this through calmly.

244
00:15:23,279 --> 00:15:24,259
Whatever the misunderstanding— I want an answer!

245
00:15:24,259 --> 00:15:24,960
We're all brothers here.

246
00:15:24,960 --> 00:15:25,879
I want an answer!

247
00:15:26,500 --> 00:15:27,039
An answer!

248
00:15:27,940 --> 00:15:28,559
An answer!

249
00:15:28,740 --> 00:15:29,379
Feng Ziwen!

250
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:30,240
Feng Ziwen!

251
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:38,440
Liu Haizhu!

252
00:15:39,500 --> 00:15:41,120
We treated you like family, like a brother!

253
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,179
And you come here to humiliate him?

254
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:44,480
Calling us thieves?

255
00:15:44,740 --> 00:15:45,860
What the hell do you take us for?

256
00:15:54,519 --> 00:15:56,159
It's because I treat you like a brother

257
00:15:56,279 --> 00:15:57,500
that I came to ask you!

258
00:15:58,460 --> 00:15:59,399
Did you do it or not?!

259
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:16,299
We didn't take it.

260
00:16:26,340 --> 00:16:27,039
It better be.
